# Delegate-model review EVIDENCE PACKETS (ai-grok-review, ai-glm, ai-muse, ai-qwen).
# The wrappers build this directory in the working tree to hand the reviewer the
# change under review. It is session scratch and must never be committable.
#
# This was previously ignored ONLY by `.git/info/exclude`, which is machine-local
# and is not part of the repository, so a fresh clone or any other machine would
# have offered the packet as an untracked commit candidate. The line below is
# NOT redundant with `.ai-review*.txt` above: that pattern matches a FILE named
# `.ai-review<something>.txt`, and the packet is a DIRECTORY containing
# MANIFEST.md and patch.diff.
.ai-review/

# Delegate-model review reports (ai-glm, ai-grok-review, ai-deepseek-agent).
# The wrappers refuse to write a report unless this path is ignored, because a
# review is session scratch and must never be committable.
.ai/reviews/
.ai/runs/
.ai/tmp/

# Local confidential business-data audits. Never commit licensed item descriptions.
.private/

# A PAUSED marker is worktree state, not repository content (#549).
# See docs/worktree-pause-protocol.md. It must never reach a pull request.
PAUSED

# The ai-devops checkout the skill-drift check uses in CI (#654).
.ai-devops-checkout/
